@startuml
title Comment Service - Create Comment/Reply Communication Flow

skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam ParticipantPadding 24
skinparam BoxPadding 12

actor User
participant "Client" as Client
participant "API Gateway\n:8888" as Gateway
participant "Comment Service\n:8085" as CommentService
participant "Comment Application\nCreateCommentUseCase" as UseCase
participant "Comment Aggregate\n(Domain)" as CommentAggregate
database "comment_db\ncomments" as CommentDb
queue "Message Broker\nKafka/RabbitMQ" as Broker
participant "Post Service\n:8083" as PostService
database "post_db\nposts" as PostDb
participant "Notification Service\n:8087" as NotificationService
database "notification_db\nnotifications" as NotificationDb

User -> Client: submit comment/reply
Client -> Gateway: POST /comments\nAuthorization: Bearer JWT
Gateway -> Gateway: validate JWT
Gateway -> CommentService: forward authenticated request

CommentService -> UseCase: CreateCommentCommand(postId, userId,\nparentCommentId?, content)
UseCase -> CommentAggregate: Comment.create(...)
CommentAggregate -> CommentAggregate: validate content not blank\nand parent rule if reply
UseCase -> CommentDb: INSERT comments(post_id, user_id,\nparent_id, content, is_deleted=false)
CommentDb --> UseCase: saved comment

UseCase -> Broker: publish CommentCreatedEvent
CommentService --> Gateway: 201 Created
Gateway --> Client: ApiResponse(comment)

Broker -> PostService: CommentCreatedEvent(postId, commentId, userId)
PostService -> PostDb: atomic increment comment_count
PostDb --> PostService: updated

Broker -> NotificationService: CommentCreatedEvent(...)
NotificationService -> NotificationDb: create notification for post owner\nor parent comment owner
NotificationDb --> NotificationService: saved

note right of CommentAggregate
DDD mapping:
- Aggregate Root: Comment
- Value Objects: CommentId, PostId, UserId,
  ParentCommentId, CommentContent, CommentStatus
- Rule: deleted comments cannot be edited
end note
@enduml
